  "name": "Open New Share for Member",
  "description": "Signs on to the Meridian Core servicing console as an operator, looks up a member by member number, runs the Open New Share action for a chosen share type and initial deposit, confirms on the CONFIRM NEW SHARE review screen and commits. Returns the confirmation number, new share ID, share type description and opening balance. This writes data: it creates a real new share account on the member record.",
